     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nYou don&#39;t need to transform the data simply properly define breaks and labels.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nIt&#39;s not clear how you want to organise your breaks. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nGet <a href=\"https://aka.ms/ghei36\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://aka.ms/ghei36&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366368386000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3jGgjhUmpANIhhGhmB81fh\">Outlook for Android</a></div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-size:11pt\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of Bogdan Tanasa &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tan...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, December 18, 2018 7:06:58 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> ggplot2<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">xcub...@gmail.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Re: Digest for <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a> - 1 update in 1 topic</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div></div>"
